      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-27T21:54:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In which usecase is the modem simulator fulfilling role 2?\n\nFor 1, I don\u0027t understand why the test should have a way to configure its phone number, it should just have a way to read it for me.\n\nOne implementation of the \"modem simulator\" could be another device with a physical sim card.\n\nWith cuttlefish we are in role 1 with a fixed number.",
      "parentUuid": "b44ebbaa_3a42b797",
      "revId": "ab7f8438e84d00faf912297880af31d96b4461d1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
